WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.130
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.400 --> 00:06.401
[This drama is intended for entertainment purposes only.]

3
00:06.411 --> 00:08.400
[All characters, behaviors, locations, and events depicted are fictional.]

4
00:08.430 --> 00:09.950
[It is not intended to be sexually suggestive or to encourage viewers]

5
00:10.000 --> 00:11.501
[to engage in inappropriate or morally objectionable behavior.]

6
00:11.511 --> 00:12.890
[Nor is it intended to discredit any profession]

7
00:12.899 --> 00:13.900
[or create negative perceptions of any organization]

8
00:13.911 --> 00:14.912
[or any particular group of people.]

9
00:14.920 --> 00:17.907
But based on the clues we have so far, our prime suspect

10
00:17.921 --> 00:19.022
is Jenphop.

11
00:19.166 --> 00:23.640
Today, Mrs. Nopnapha is about to slap that shameless bitch Mutta again!

12
00:23.651 --> 00:26.520
Today, someone who was once her victim is fighting back!

13
00:29.235 --> 00:30.520
Mutta, you bitch!

14
00:30.531 --> 00:32.120
You're going to die a horrible death!

15
00:32.254 --> 00:35.800
Our ministry is overstaffed. We need to unnecessary positions.

16
00:35.896 --> 00:38.207
They're not firing everyone, just two people.

17
00:38.220 --> 00:39.240
I'm one of the two

18
00:40.721 --> 00:41.722
who has to go, right?

19
00:42.075 --> 00:44.400
I'm sick of my family. Just looking for someone to talk to.

20
00:44.624 --> 00:45.925
I'm sick of mine too.

21
00:46.096 --> 00:49.097
Hey, have you ever stumbled upon any of your dad's secrets?

22
00:49.200 --> 00:52.201
If they have any secrets, they're probably hidden at work.

23
00:53.859 --> 00:55.000
Fire!

24
01:03.355 --> 01:04.646
Ta! Where is Ta?

25
01:04.742 --> 01:08.200
Oh, I saw her leave the office a while before the alarm went off.

26
01:34.896 --> 01:35.897
Ta?

27
01:36.011 --> 01:37.012
Veekit.

28
01:44.558 --> 01:45.559
What are you doing in here?

29
01:50.280 --> 01:52.281
[Hong]

30
01:57.747 --> 01:59.680
You've known about Director and Hong all along, haven't you?

31
02:01.550 --> 02:03.560
I've told you so many times to stay away from Uncle Phop.

32
02:03.912 --> 02:04.915
But you wouldn't listen.

33
02:04.920 --> 02:06.387
Then why didn't you ever tell me about Hong?

34
02:06.568 --> 02:08.000
What good would that have done, Ta?

35
02:08.400 --> 02:10.200
Would you have left Uncle Phop if I'd told you?

36
02:13.443 --> 02:14.800
How long have they been sleeping together?

37
02:16.472 --> 02:17.473
A long time.

38
02:20.230 --> 02:21.280
Even before you came along.

39
02:24.160 --> 02:25.240
Are they still seeing each other?

40
02:32.912 --> 02:34.640
What other secrets have you been keeping from me?

41
02:36.054 --> 02:37.055
Tell me everything.

42
02:41.579 --> 02:42.580
I'm the one

43
02:43.259 --> 02:44.760
who should be asking you that.

44
04:27.475 --> 04:28.520
Hello.

45
04:28.900 --> 04:29.701
Hello.

46
04:29.801 --> 04:30.802
Shall we get going?

47
04:31.320 --> 04:32.321
Sure.

48
04:44.700 --> 04:45.701
This way, please.

49
04:46.080 --> 04:47.440
Sorry about the mess.

50
04:47.640 --> 04:48.760
Thanks for having me.

51
04:53.862 --> 04:54.863
I brought you something.

52
04:55.110 --> 04:57.740
Wow! Thank you!

53
04:57.931 --> 05:01.640
It's huge. Is this a Jintara watermelon?

54
05:02.320 --> 05:04.440
No, it's a Kinnaree kind.

55
05:04.450 --> 05:05.680
Jintara watermelons are expensive.

56
05:15.707 --> 05:16.720
Take it off.

57
05:18.422 --> 05:21.080
Aren't you going to take off your mask too?

58
05:21.654 --> 05:24.400
I can't take it off. It's part of my uniform.

59
05:24.744 --> 05:27.045
Then how are you supposed to put it in your mouth?

60
05:29.363 --> 05:30.364
Don't worry.

61
05:32.419 --> 05:34.700
I've done this for hundreds of people.

62
06:07.326 --> 06:08.720
Thank you so much.

63
06:09.347 --> 06:10.960
I'll come see you again sometime.

64
06:12.259 --> 06:14.000
Thank you too.

65
06:15.260 --> 06:16.261
But next time,

66
06:17.384 --> 06:21.485
could you bring me jicama or snow lotus fruit instead?

67
06:21.710 --> 06:23.700
I'm getting tired of watermelon.

68
06:24.755 --> 06:25.756
Sure.

69
06:26.963 --> 06:28.040
Wait a moment.

70
06:36.056 --> 06:37.560
A little souvenir for you.

71
06:49.560 --> 06:50.760
Thank you so much.

72
06:51.059 --> 06:52.760
- See you again. - Sure.

73
06:54.046 --> 06:55.047
Hong.

74
07:00.568 --> 07:01.920
Hong, wait!

75
07:03.288 --> 07:04.880
Where are you going? Can't you hear me calling?

76
07:06.851 --> 07:10.083
Oh, Ta!

77
07:10.691 --> 07:12.320
I didn't realize it was you.

78
07:12.936 --> 07:14.600
What brings you here?

79
07:30.510 --> 07:33.120
That was my brother just now.

80
07:33.219 --> 07:34.920
He doesn't visit very often.

81
07:35.982 --> 07:37.896
Let me cut up some watermelon for you.

82
07:40.283 --> 07:41.284
What kind of brother

83
07:41.986 --> 07:44.087
gets underwear as a souvenir?

84
07:47.614 --> 07:50.760
You saw that? You've got sharp eyes.

85
07:51.875 --> 07:56.280
Well, my brother stayed over last month and left them behind.

86
07:56.574 --> 07:58.238
I accidentally put them on.

87
07:58.320 --> 08:00.520
When I realized, I washed them and gave them back.

88
08:00.670 --> 08:03.170
Men are so messy, aren't they?

89
08:07.700 --> 08:10.483
Oh! Whose is that?

90
08:10.574 --> 08:12.575
Why does it have my name on it?

91
08:13.035 --> 08:14.360
Drop the act already.

92
08:15.606 --> 08:17.520
I know everything about you and the Director.

93
08:30.267 --> 08:33.040
Ta, please don't bring this up again.

94
08:34.300 --> 08:35.301
I'm...

95
08:35.664 --> 08:37.480
I'm deeply hurt.

96
08:39.030 --> 08:40.320
The Director...

97
08:41.712 --> 08:43.880
He forced himself on me.

98
08:44.800 --> 08:47.560
He took my virginity.

99
09:01.995 --> 09:03.040
I found it on a website.

100
09:03.536 --> 09:04.537
Onlyfun.

101
09:07.062 --> 09:08.400
How did you find it?

102
09:08.763 --> 09:09.800
I subscribed, of course.

103
09:10.726 --> 09:12.300
Standard or Gold?

104
09:12.688 --> 09:15.189
Premium. I get to watch everything three days early.

105
09:16.683 --> 09:20.040
Oh... What were they doing in the video?

106
09:20.064 --> 09:22.080
I've never seen it before.

107
09:24.451 --> 09:26.960
Judging by the camera angle, I'd say...

108
09:28.579 --> 09:30.520
Ta... Ta, please!

109
09:30.580 --> 09:31.581
Ta!

110
09:32.110 --> 09:33.111
Ta!

111
09:41.878 --> 09:42.879
Ta!

112
09:43.640 --> 09:44.641
Ta!

113
09:46.032 --> 09:47.320
What are you doing?

114
09:48.656 --> 09:49.657
Ta!

115
09:59.400 --> 10:00.401
Oh!

116
10:01.032 --> 10:04.086
When did someone hide a camera inside this duck?

117
10:14.904 --> 10:16.400
I talked to some people in your building.

118
10:17.726 --> 10:19.720
They said you invite

119
10:20.296 --> 10:22.240
dozens of different men to your room every month.

120
10:23.256 --> 10:24.920
Each one has to bring you a gift.

121
10:26.011 --> 10:28.080
And you give them underwear in return.

122
10:30.536 --> 10:33.600
I don't care what you do on the side.

123
10:34.630 --> 10:36.760
I just want you to know that I've figured out

124
10:37.014 --> 10:39.515
you're not the sweet, innocent little bird you pretend to be.

125
10:40.134 --> 10:42.600
So please,

126
10:43.640 --> 10:45.560
drop the act for just ten minutes

127
10:46.441 --> 10:47.880
so we can have a proper conversation.

128
10:56.451 --> 10:58.600
But I've never

129
10:59.848 --> 11:03.120
pretended to be someone I'm not, Ta.

130
11:07.240 --> 11:09.241
What do you want to talk about?

131
11:09.976 --> 11:11.843
I'll be completely honest with you.

132
11:11.900 --> 11:12.920
The Director.

133
11:14.072 --> 11:16.672
But I think we both know

134
11:16.880 --> 11:19.560
everything there is to know about him.

135
11:21.136 --> 11:24.118
His size, his moves...

136
11:25.558 --> 11:28.334
You might even know him better than I do.

137
11:29.054 --> 11:32.254
I want to know what happened when I was away.

138
11:33.400 --> 11:34.760
When he came on to you, did he ever mention me?

139
11:36.822 --> 11:38.240
Not really.

140
11:38.939 --> 11:40.760
He only moaned my name.

141
11:43.568 --> 11:44.600
What about the pregnancy?

142
11:46.394 --> 11:50.520
He told me to keep a close eye on my body.

143
11:51.710 --> 11:54.880
If I accidentally got pregnant, I should get an abortion.

144
11:55.875 --> 11:58.720
He said I could still get one before five months.

145
11:59.667 --> 12:00.668
An abortion?

146
12:01.731 --> 12:03.160
What would happen if you refused?

147
12:07.400 --> 12:09.401
He'd probably kill me.

148
12:11.155 --> 12:13.600
He'd be afraid I'd use the baby to blackmail him.

149
12:14.803 --> 12:16.312
After all,

150
12:16.654 --> 12:20.720
he'll be dependent on Mrs. Nopnapha for the rest of his life.

151
12:24.600 --> 12:27.201
But isn't that just the life of a mistress?

152
12:28.376 --> 12:32.560
Men will always choose their wives in the end.

153
12:33.467 --> 12:37.344
We're just there to satisfy their desires.

154
12:43.680 --> 12:45.181
Are you pregnant, Ta?

155
12:46.379 --> 12:48.760
No. I was just curious.

156
13:01.552 --> 13:02.553
Uncle Phop.

157
13:11.280 --> 13:12.281
What happened?

158
13:13.483 --> 13:15.040
Someone broke into my office and searched it.

159
13:16.950 --> 13:19.320
It must've happened the other day when the fire alarm went off.

160
13:22.951 --> 13:23.952
Really?

161
13:26.168 --> 13:30.000
Is anything valuable or any important information missing?

162
13:31.320 --> 13:32.360
Not that I've found so far.

163
13:35.272 --> 13:38.440
I want to know who did it and what they were after,

164
13:39.939 --> 13:41.200
so I can deal with them.

165
13:50.880 --> 13:53.560
Tetris, Titus! Over here, sweethearts!

166
13:54.406 --> 13:55.407
Mom!

167
14:02.027 --> 14:04.760
Hi, Mom! Why did you come to pick us up today?

168
14:07.435 --> 14:09.440
Tetris, could you sit in the back, sweetheart?

169
14:09.510 --> 14:11.120
I want to talk to your sister today.

170
14:13.560 --> 14:14.561
Okay.

171
14:15.520 --> 14:16.521
Thank you, sweetheart.

172
14:52.416 --> 14:55.640
I know it doesn't look as pretty as before.

173
14:55.934 --> 14:57.902
But I really tried my best.

174
15:02.168 --> 15:04.920
I'm sorry. I lost my temper.

175
15:07.102 --> 15:08.104
But you know

176
15:09.016 --> 15:10.840
that woman drives me crazy.

177
15:12.696 --> 15:14.184
If you don't want to see me like that again,

178
15:15.739 --> 15:17.080
can you please stay away from her?

179
15:18.571 --> 15:19.572
No.

180
15:20.134 --> 15:22.280
I need to talk to Ta every day.

181
15:24.443 --> 15:26.400
Because you never have time to talk to me.

182
15:30.174 --> 15:32.286
So if I make more time for you,

183
15:33.448 --> 15:34.622
you'll stop talking to her, right?

184
15:36.763 --> 15:37.764
Maybe.

185
15:40.811 --> 15:42.038
Then what would you like to eat today, sweetheart?

186
15:43.030 --> 15:45.920
How about pizza followed by some ice cream?

187
15:48.928 --> 15:50.360
I don't like ice cream.

188
15:51.254 --> 15:52.600
I like bingsu.

189
15:56.056 --> 15:58.160
Okay, got it.

190
15:59.157 --> 16:00.158
Bingsu it is.

191
16:05.678 --> 16:06.679
What is it, Oshi?

192
16:07.272 --> 16:08.400
Big trouble, ma'am.

193
16:08.856 --> 16:10.400
Hong just sent word that...

194
16:10.467 --> 16:12.200
Wait, don't say anything yet.

195
16:16.707 --> 16:17.708
What did you say?

196
16:17.902 --> 16:19.960
That bitch Mutta is pregnant with the Director's baby again!

197
16:23.712 --> 16:26.300
Don't hang up. Give me a moment.

198
16:29.576 --> 16:30.680
Tetris and Titus.

199
16:31.214 --> 16:34.080
I have something urgent to take care of. I'm sorry, sweethearts.

200
16:56.936 --> 16:59.300
She's pregnant again? Who told you?

201
16:59.800 --> 17:00.801
Hong, ma'am.

202
17:09.472 --> 17:10.800
Hey, Chuenchom.

203
17:11.323 --> 17:13.160
When we get to the hospital,

204
17:13.568 --> 17:16.569
you'd better apologize to Toey on everyone's behalf.

205
17:16.806 --> 17:21.120
It was your idea to put Toey in that wheelchair.

206
17:21.140 --> 17:21.800
Got it?

207
17:21.888 --> 17:24.520
Hey, why is it my fault?

208
17:24.742 --> 17:27.000
Whoever's the strongest is the one to blame.

209
17:27.678 --> 17:29.800
I had nothing to do with it. I wasn't pushing.

210
17:29.960 --> 17:31.720
I barely even touched him.

211
17:33.200 --> 17:35.880
If we'd put Toey on the photocopier in the first place,

212
17:35.900 --> 17:38.254
we wouldn't have ended up in this mess, right?

213
17:44.288 --> 17:45.289
Ta.

214
17:45.611 --> 17:47.680
Hey, where did Ta go?

215
17:47.720 --> 17:49.621
Wasn't she just walking with us?

216
17:50.782 --> 17:53.500
- Maybe she stopped to take a dump. - Oh, does she have diarrhea?

217
17:53.512 --> 17:55.400
Which funeral hall is Toey in again?

218
17:55.528 --> 17:57.500
We just saw him the other day. What a shame!

219
17:57.544 --> 17:58.680
I'll slap your mouth right off.

220
17:58.963 --> 18:00.400
He's just sick, not dead.

221
18:00.566 --> 18:02.240
Keep running your mouth and I'll have Toey fire you.

222
18:02.367 --> 18:04.880
Watch your own mouth, old lady, or I'll slap your dentures loose!

223
18:05.376 --> 18:07.080
- Let me go! - Get her!

224
18:22.368 --> 18:23.369
Stop!

225
18:23.926 --> 18:24.927
Stop the van!

226
18:28.352 --> 18:29.353
Stop!

227
18:35.040 --> 18:38.000
Hey, security! What was that van that just came in?

228
18:38.176 --> 18:39.800
I'm not sure, ma'am.

229
18:40.224 --> 18:42.500
Then why did you let it in? Didn't they have to show ID?

230
18:43.515 --> 18:46.616
A senior official radioed in and told us to let that van through.

231
18:46.800 --> 18:48.880
He said it was strictly confidential.

232
18:49.801 --> 18:50.880
Which senior official?

233
18:51.720 --> 18:53.821
Well...

234
18:54.240 --> 18:55.241
Mr. Thaithat.

235
19:04.643 --> 19:06.160
I'm hungry. Give me the pear first.

236
19:06.440 --> 19:07.441
No!

237
19:07.475 --> 19:10.000
Oh, Ta! Come on, let's go visit Toey.

238
19:10.040 --> 19:11.041
I'm not going anymore!

239
19:12.131 --> 19:13.132
Everyone!

240
19:13.822 --> 19:15.823
How did Ta get ahead of us?

241
19:16.067 --> 19:17.840
Wasn't she walking behind us just a moment ago?

242
19:18.483 --> 19:19.680
What's she in such a hurry for?

243
19:19.784 --> 19:22.040
If I didn't know her, I'd think she was a purse snatcher.

244
19:25.379 --> 19:28.440
Why the hell is our ministry so huge? My feet are killing me!

245
19:40.360 --> 19:41.361
Ta!

246
19:42.000 --> 19:43.001
Ta!

247
19:44.072 --> 19:45.073
Ta!

248
19:45.448 --> 19:46.600
Oh, Ta!

249
19:47.379 --> 19:48.480
What happened?

250
19:48.771 --> 19:50.360
Someone grabbed me and dragged me into a van.

251
19:50.451 --> 19:52.120
They stuck a needle in my arm,

252
19:52.152 --> 19:53.600
then kicked me out onto the side of the road.

253
19:53.653 --> 19:54.454
What?

254
19:54.483 --> 19:56.483
Where did this happen?

255
19:56.606 --> 19:57.702
Right here at the Ministry.

256
19:58.110 --> 20:01.320
Nopnapha's the only one who'd stoop to something this vile.

257
20:04.446 --> 20:05.520
She's gone too far.

258
20:06.291 --> 20:09.000
Wait here, Ta. I'll deal with her myself.

259
20:15.000 --> 20:16.001
Ta.

260
20:17.101 --> 20:18.160
Let's get your wounds treated first. Come on.

261
20:28.214 --> 20:29.480
Did you see their faces?

262
20:30.390 --> 20:32.360
No. They were wearing ski masks.

263
20:32.640 --> 20:33.680
The van didn't have license plates either.

264
20:34.267 --> 20:37.531
And if we ask for the CCTV footage, the cameras will probably be broken again.

265
20:39.798 --> 20:41.520
What did you do to provoke Aunt Napha this time

266
20:41.728 --> 20:43.640
that made her send someone after you?

267
20:44.136 --> 20:46.240
Veekit, are you victim-blaming me?

268
20:47.100 --> 20:49.720
What could possibly justify Nopnapha doing this to me?

269
20:49.774 --> 20:52.739
No, I just want to know if you did anything to upset her,

270
20:53.181 --> 20:54.500
so I can figure out

271
20:55.843 --> 20:57.520
what she's trying to get revenge on you for.

272
21:00.814 --> 21:02.200
And what did they inject you with?

273
21:03.866 --> 21:07.240
Or was it just an empty syringe to freak you out?

274
21:10.392 --> 21:12.040
I haven't done anything to her

275
21:13.027 --> 21:14.400
since I went to their house.

276
21:14.995 --> 21:16.600
All I've done is talk to Tetris.

277
21:17.070 --> 21:18.071
What?

278
21:19.272 --> 21:20.273
Who did you say you were talking to?

279
21:20.696 --> 21:22.680
Titus. I got their names mixed up.

280
21:31.171 --> 21:32.440
When they stuck the needle in you,

281
21:33.384 --> 21:35.885
did you feel anything being injected?

282
21:36.520 --> 21:37.521
I don't know.

283
21:37.912 --> 21:39.760
I was too scared to notice anything.

284
21:40.136 --> 21:42.840
All I know is that they stuck a needle in me.

285
21:44.137 --> 21:45.180
Does your arm hurt now?

286
21:48.414 --> 21:49.415
No.

287
22:01.944 --> 22:02.945
Okay.

288
22:03.480 --> 22:04.810
Let's get you to a doctor afterward

289
22:05.840 --> 22:07.734
to check if anything's wrong.

290
22:08.041 --> 22:10.080
You might need antiviral medication as a precaution.

291
22:27.024 --> 22:28.880
Hey! Where's Napha?

292
22:30.128 --> 22:32.720
She's picking up Tetris and Titus from school.

293
22:33.446 --> 22:35.480
What did Napha do to Ta?

294
22:38.379 --> 22:40.683
- What? - I asked you what Napha did to Ta!

295
22:41.270 --> 22:43.960
Ta was abducted in a van and stabbed with a syringe!

296
22:44.112 --> 22:45.113
What did she do to her?

297
22:46.113 --> 22:47.114
Well...

298
22:47.718 --> 22:49.719
We didn't do anything.

299
22:50.267 --> 22:52.384
Then why the hell are you so nervous?

300
22:52.440 --> 22:54.120
Huh? Why are you panicking?

301
22:54.246 --> 22:55.280
Tell me the truth!

302
22:55.656 --> 22:57.240
Please don't hurt me! I'm just a gay!

303
22:57.250 --> 22:59.880
Director, you'd better ask Nopnapha yourself.

304
22:59.910 --> 23:02.280
I already called her! She won't answer! Tell me!

305
23:02.691 --> 23:04.200
But we're just her assistants.

306
23:04.278 --> 23:05.560
We can't really say much.

307
23:05.640 --> 23:06.641
I know

308
23:06.915 --> 23:09.990
you two do all of Napha's dirty work!

309
23:10.152 --> 23:12.170
Tell me what you did! Huh?

310
23:12.478 --> 23:14.040
Director, please let go!

311
23:14.158 --> 23:16.190
This is serious misconduct. You could get fired!

312
23:16.220 --> 23:19.560
And what you did to Ta isn't serious? Huh?

313
23:19.600 --> 23:20.601
Huh?

314
23:20.952 --> 23:21.953
You're not going to tell me, are you?

315
23:22.153 --> 23:23.654
Let go of my staff right now!

316
23:28.120 --> 23:29.121
What did you do to Ta?

317
23:31.090 --> 23:32.120
She's pregnant.

318
23:33.520 --> 23:35.080
What? Pregnant?

319
23:36.866 --> 23:37.867
How did she get pregnant?

320
23:39.760 --> 23:43.120
Maybe she got pregnant by just standing on one leg and swallowing air!

321
23:47.830 --> 23:49.640
Because you slept with her, you idiot!

322
23:50.619 --> 23:51.840
How the hell is that possible?

323
23:52.768 --> 23:55.320
I've only slept with her once since she came back after her miscarriage.

324
23:56.787 --> 23:57.788
Well...

325
23:58.238 --> 24:00.080
I guess I've still got it.

326
24:01.491 --> 24:03.800
Is this really the time to be proud of yourself?

327
24:04.040 --> 24:06.141
Is this the time to brag?

328
24:07.288 --> 24:08.560
So what exactly did you do to Ta?

329
24:09.230 --> 24:10.520
What did you inject her with?

330
24:20.536 --> 24:23.100
What time are you taking your next dose? Have you decided?

331
24:24.419 --> 24:25.600
Let's say 6 a.m.

332
24:25.960 --> 24:27.520
I'll take it as soon as I wake up so I won't forget.

333
24:28.699 --> 24:31.500
Then I'll call you at 6:05 every day

334
24:31.854 --> 24:32.855
just in case you forget.

335
24:34.571 --> 24:36.040
I can set an alarm on my phone, you know.

336
24:36.486 --> 24:37.760
Why do you have to call me?

337
24:38.784 --> 24:39.785
Because I want to talk to you.

338
24:42.000 --> 24:43.001
Suit yourself.

339
24:47.678 --> 24:48.880
Are you still shaken up?

340
24:49.982 --> 24:51.200
I can stay and keep you company tonight.

341
24:54.355 --> 24:56.480
You always treat me like I'm so helpless.

342
24:57.523 --> 24:59.724
Thanks, but you should go home.

343
25:01.600 --> 25:02.601
Are you sure?

344
25:03.001 --> 25:04.280
Yeah, I'm sure.

345
25:07.960 --> 25:10.640
What if Aunt Napha injected you with a zombie virus?

346
25:10.867 --> 25:12.600
What if you turn into a zombie and go on a rampage tonight?

347
25:13.843 --> 25:15.120
Then you definitely shouldn't stay, right?

348
25:21.000 --> 25:23.500
Then call me if you feel like you're about to transform.

349
25:25.000 --> 25:26.001
Okay.

350
25:32.900 --> 25:33.901
I'm off.

351
25:39.400 --> 25:40.401
Last chance to change your mind.

352
25:41.401 --> 25:42.440
Just go.

353
25:44.011 --> 25:45.500
Okay, I won't bother you anymore.

354
25:47.500 --> 25:48.501
See you.

355
26:20.640 --> 26:22.680
Can you make a rabbit appear? I want one.

356
27:32.110 --> 27:34.035
Na, has Uncle Phop come home yet?

357
27:34.050 --> 27:35.051
Not yet.

358
27:37.011 --> 27:39.240
- What about Aunt Napha? - She's not home either.

359
27:47.800 --> 27:48.801
Ta.

360
27:50.500 --> 27:51.680
It's me, Ta.

361
27:52.086 --> 27:53.287
Please open the door.

362
27:53.320 --> 27:56.321
Director.

363
27:59.000 --> 28:00.120
What is it?

364
28:00.740 --> 28:01.780
Are you pregnant, Ta?

365
28:02.454 --> 28:04.480
Then why didn't you tell me?

366
28:05.792 --> 28:08.500
Come on, Ta. Open the door, please.

367
28:09.446 --> 28:12.560
If I accidentally got pregnant, I should get an abortion.

368
28:13.200 --> 28:14.640
What would happen if you refused?

369
28:14.801 --> 28:16.760
He'd probably kill me.

370
28:17.254 --> 28:19.800
He'd be afraid I'd use the baby to blackmail him.

371
28:21.059 --> 28:22.400
After all,

372
28:22.780 --> 28:26.840
he'll be dependent on Mrs. Nopnapha for the rest of his life.

373
28:28.051 --> 28:29.052
Ta.

374
28:29.176 --> 28:30.177
Ta!

375
28:30.744 --> 28:31.800
Open the door.

376
28:32.400 --> 28:33.640
Just a moment, Director.

377
28:52.566 --> 28:53.567
Ta.

378
29:13.600 --> 29:14.680
Are you really pregnant?

379
29:16.900 --> 29:17.901
Yes.

380
29:18.232 --> 29:19.233
I'm pregnant.

381
29:20.500 --> 29:22.501
It happened that afternoon we went to the hotel.

382
29:22.900 --> 29:23.901
I got pregnant after just one time.

383
29:24.819 --> 29:25.820
What the hell?

384
29:26.136 --> 29:28.320
Didn't you say you had a contraceptive implant?

385
29:28.600 --> 29:29.961
How could you get pregnant?

386
29:30.600 --> 29:32.100
It's not 100% effective.

387
29:33.500 --> 29:35.200
But I'm not having an abortion.

388
29:36.110 --> 29:37.311
I'm keeping the baby.

389
29:53.678 --> 29:54.880
That's the right decision.

390
29:56.947 --> 29:58.240
It's our baby, after all.

391
29:58.995 --> 30:00.180
How could we abort our own child?

392
30:07.550 --> 30:10.840
I know I may have said I didn't want children,

393
30:11.600 --> 30:13.320
but now that we've brought a child into this world,

394
30:13.630 --> 30:14.740
we have to raise it.

395
30:16.100 --> 30:17.101
Here's what we'll do.

396
30:19.123 --> 30:20.862
I'll take you for your prenatal checkups.

397
30:21.464 --> 30:24.320
As for our future, we'll figure that out later.

398
30:28.336 --> 30:30.827
But how did you know I was pregnant, Director?

399
30:32.214 --> 30:33.320
I'm not the only one who knows.

400
30:33.894 --> 30:35.360
Napha knows too.

401
30:35.808 --> 30:37.040
Her informant told her.

402
30:38.000 --> 30:39.001
Well...

403
30:39.776 --> 30:41.520
The reason she had people abduct you

404
30:41.900 --> 30:44.040
was just to draw your blood and confirm whether you're really pregnant.

405
30:44.854 --> 30:46.100
It wasn't anything dangerous.

406
30:48.216 --> 30:49.280
A blood test?

407
30:51.200 --> 30:52.201
Yes.

408
30:54.560 --> 30:55.920
The results should be back tonight.

409
31:06.664 --> 31:07.665
And these

410
31:10.424 --> 31:12.400
are vitamins and prenatal supplements.

411
31:13.520 --> 31:15.360
Just take them like you did during your last pregnancy.

412
31:31.726 --> 31:32.727
What?

413
31:32.883 --> 31:34.600
So all our suspicions about Jenphop

414
31:34.744 --> 31:36.120
were just in our heads?

415
31:36.552 --> 31:39.411
Yeah. He's a better person than we thought.

416
31:40.075 --> 31:41.400
He really loves his child.

417
31:41.584 --> 31:44.312
He even gave me some prenatal supplements.

418
31:45.438 --> 31:47.032
And his burner phone?

419
31:47.896 --> 31:48.958
He uses it to bet on football.

420
31:49.304 --> 31:51.174
He said he was afraid of ruining his reputation if he got caught.

421
31:51.180 --> 31:52.520
So that's why he uses a burner phone.

422
31:53.523 --> 31:55.000
What a complete waste of time!

423
31:57.363 --> 31:58.520
I don't think it was a waste.

424
31:59.992 --> 32:01.240
Now we know for sure

425
32:02.083 --> 32:03.200
that Nopnapha

426
32:04.000 --> 32:05.160
was the one who killed my sister.

427
32:06.291 --> 32:07.560
We've been going after the right person.

428
32:08.862 --> 32:10.120
And it also made me realize

429
32:10.723 --> 32:12.160
she didn't just kill my sister.

430
32:13.400 --> 32:14.760
She killed my niece or nephew, too.

431
32:15.931 --> 32:17.120
From now on,

432
32:18.000 --> 32:19.401
I'm going all out against her.

433
32:26.411 --> 32:28.040
And what the hell are these prenatal supplements?

434
32:28.571 --> 32:29.840
Why don't they have any labels?

435
32:44.171 --> 32:45.500
Here we go.

436
32:45.870 --> 32:48.040
Daddy's special steamed eggs.

437
32:48.392 --> 32:50.760
Ready to serve.

438
32:50.810 --> 32:54.480
This one's yours, with extra sausage.

439
32:54.511 --> 32:57.100
And this one's Titus's, loaded with crab sticks.

440
32:57.590 --> 32:59.400
Dig in!

441
33:04.112 --> 33:05.920
You kids are so lucky.

442
33:06.742 --> 33:09.400
Your dad makes you steamed eggs every morning.

443
33:16.774 --> 33:18.440
But from now on...

444
33:19.200 --> 33:21.801
But what if, one day, Dad has to split his time with another family

445
33:22.294 --> 33:25.040
and make steamed eggs for someone else's kids?

446
33:25.963 --> 33:27.880
How would you two feel?

447
33:27.900 --> 33:28.901
Hey!

448
33:30.016 --> 33:31.880
Can you stop ruining this lovely morning

449
33:32.070 --> 33:33.700
by turning the kids against me?

450
33:35.808 --> 33:37.240
Kids, don't listen to your mother.

451
33:37.347 --> 33:39.971
I promise I'll never leave you.

452
33:40.500 --> 33:43.001
I love you two more than anything in the world. Believe me.

453
33:45.000 --> 33:48.601
If you want them to believe you, stop having affairs.

454
33:49.075 --> 33:50.755
Stop getting women pregnant left and right

455
33:50.840 --> 33:52.974
and leaving us to clean up your messes.

456
33:53.064 --> 33:55.640
- One slip-up could ruin everything. - Can we not discuss this in front of the kids?

457
33:56.705 --> 33:58.960
Shouldn't they know what kind of man their father is?

458
33:59.360 --> 34:01.640
If you're ashamed of yourself, then stop doing it.

459
34:06.726 --> 34:08.927
Mutta's pregnancy test results are back.

460
34:10.864 --> 34:12.465
Go on. Say it loud and clear.

461
34:12.800 --> 34:14.101
She's not pregnant!

462
34:15.376 --> 34:16.377
What?

463
34:16.912 --> 34:17.913
She's not pregnant?

464
34:21.811 --> 34:22.812
What the hell?

465
34:23.363 --> 34:25.000
I was just talking to her about our baby yesterday!

466
34:26.616 --> 34:30.080
She was playing mind games with you, and you fell for it!

467
34:30.440 --> 34:31.726
You're such an idiot.

468
34:31.838 --> 34:33.450
You fall for every trick she pulls.

469
34:33.480 --> 34:34.856
Will you stop calling me an idiot?

470
34:35.651 --> 34:36.717
I'm your husband!

471
34:37.200 --> 34:38.410
Show me some respect!

472
34:39.389 --> 34:41.110
What's there to respect about a husband like you?

473
34:42.462 --> 34:45.120
If I can't call you an idiot, should I call you a moron instead?

474
34:45.464 --> 34:46.920
- Would that sound better? - Napha!

475
35:00.286 --> 35:02.600
Hurry up and eat, kids, or you'll be late for school.

476
35:08.700 --> 35:11.401
Ta, so you're not pregnant after all?

477
35:11.784 --> 35:13.533
Come see me in my office when you get to the Ministry.

478
35:14.894 --> 35:17.400
And throw away those pills I gave you.

479
35:17.495 --> 35:18.496
Okay.

480
35:19.000 --> 35:20.001
Bye, then.

481
35:27.808 --> 35:29.920
So, are you pregnant or not, Ta?

482
35:31.704 --> 35:33.280
How did you hear about that, Titus?

483
35:34.574 --> 35:36.160
I heard Mom and Dad fighting.

484
35:37.500 --> 35:38.920
I'm not pregnant, sweetie.

485
35:39.368 --> 35:40.640
It was just a misunderstanding.

486
35:42.032 --> 35:44.731
Aww! Now I won't get a little sibling!

487
35:49.814 --> 35:52.520
That mistress spread fake news to Mom that she's pregnant.

488
35:52.614 --> 35:53.615
She's so evil!

489
35:54.500 --> 35:57.100
I don't think so. Why would she do that?

490
35:57.990 --> 35:59.531
To make Mom and Dad fight, obviously!

491
35:59.627 --> 36:01.600
They were just going at each other like crazy.

492
36:02.109 --> 36:03.210
Are you okay?

493
36:03.875 --> 36:06.176
How could I be okay when my parents are fighting?

494
36:14.300 --> 36:15.301
Give me your money!

495
36:15.600 --> 36:16.601
Hey!

496
36:16.806 --> 36:19.760
You were out selling yourself just last night!

497
36:19.900 --> 36:21.000
I saw you!

498
36:21.392 --> 36:23.520
Give me the money! I need to buy booze!

499
36:23.560 --> 36:24.661
Hurry the hell up!

500
36:24.880 --> 36:26.881
- You wanna drink so badly? - Yeah!

501
36:29.283 --> 36:31.600
Then drink this! Here, drink up!

502
36:31.654 --> 36:33.920
Go on! You wanna drink? Drink!

503
36:34.020 --> 36:35.080
You damn freeloader!

504
36:35.321 --> 36:36.322
Blood!

505
36:39.184 --> 36:41.300
You actually made me bleed?

506
36:41.320 --> 36:42.521
Why the hell wouldn't I?

507
36:50.336 --> 36:51.337
Don't you dare!

508
36:54.334 --> 36:56.360
Are you my wife or a rabid dog?

509
36:57.128 --> 36:58.560
Fine! I'll find myself another wife!

510
36:59.100 --> 37:00.600
Go to hell for all I care!

511
37:04.200 --> 37:07.160
Come back and take one of your kids with you!

512
37:07.301 --> 37:08.320
You bastard!

513
37:09.440 --> 37:11.480
I don't want to raise them! Come take one!

514
37:14.843 --> 37:17.280
Ever since that mistress came back, they've been fighting more often.

515
37:17.494 --> 37:18.495
It's getting worse.

516
37:20.576 --> 37:21.577
I'm sorry.

517
37:22.300 --> 37:23.401
What are you sorry for?

518
37:25.109 --> 37:26.110
Nothing.

519
37:26.640 --> 37:27.880
Don't dwell on it, okay?

520
37:28.395 --> 37:30.096
Let the adults sort it out.

521
37:30.880 --> 37:31.960
I'll try.

522
37:32.601 --> 37:34.300
You can always talk to me about anything.

523
37:35.000 --> 37:36.001
Thanks.

524
37:58.100 --> 37:59.566
Hi, Ta.

525
37:59.966 --> 38:01.880
Where did you go yesterday?

526
38:01.970 --> 38:03.740
Why didn't you come visit Toey with us?

527
38:05.056 --> 38:06.341
You should know.

528
38:06.680 --> 38:07.840
Don't pretend you don't.

529
38:08.592 --> 38:11.131
Aren't you the one spying on me for Nopnapha?

530
38:13.611 --> 38:17.147
What spy, Ta? I don't understand.

531
38:18.715 --> 38:20.198
Besides being such a phony,

532
38:20.736 --> 38:22.100
you need to stop lying, too.

533
38:22.720 --> 38:24.600
You're the only person I told about my pregnancy.

534
38:25.021 --> 38:26.122
If it wasn't you,

535
38:26.355 --> 38:29.070
who the hell else could've told Nopnapha?

536
38:35.000 --> 38:36.001
Ta.

537
38:37.990 --> 38:39.910
I'm on your side.

538
38:41.083 --> 38:43.084
Cut the crap.

539
38:49.259 --> 38:51.968
Well, civil servants don't make much money.

540
38:53.595 --> 38:55.880
It's barely enough to cover my train fare.

541
38:57.251 --> 39:01.171
So I have to take on side jobs for her sometimes.

542
39:01.534 --> 39:04.480
Including having sex in exchange for fruits and vegetables, right?

543
39:08.400 --> 39:11.401
Ta! Don't talk about that here!

544
39:11.942 --> 39:15.195
So it's fine for you to report my business, but yours is off-limits?

545
39:20.152 --> 39:22.320
Please, Ta, I'm begging you.

546
39:23.688 --> 39:26.680
Don't tell anyone about this.

547
39:27.918 --> 39:31.640
I'll stop spying for her if you want.

548
39:34.702 --> 39:35.703
No need.

549
39:36.500 --> 39:38.011
Keep spying for her.

550
39:38.645 --> 39:40.149
But whatever you report to her

551
39:40.939 --> 39:42.560
has to come from me and me alone.

552
39:44.741 --> 39:48.720
Then I'd be betraying her.

553
39:49.043 --> 39:50.800
I'd be playing both sides.

554
39:51.784 --> 39:53.267
Oh, so you've got such high morals now?

555
39:54.155 --> 39:55.156
Are you saying you can't do it?

556
39:55.544 --> 39:56.645
I can.

557
39:57.432 --> 39:59.880
And from now on, you'll help me

558
40:00.296 --> 40:01.800
whenever I need you.

559
40:04.206 --> 40:05.640
Yes, Ta.

560
40:07.443 --> 40:08.445
By the way,

561
40:09.928 --> 40:12.520
how much will you pay me per job?

562
40:13.709 --> 40:17.320
Nopnapha pays me 5,000 baht a job, you know?

563
40:17.600 --> 40:19.960
What a liar! More like 500!

564
40:23.056 --> 40:26.600
550, then. That's 50 more than she pays me.

565
40:27.500 --> 40:30.900
Actually, I don't have to pay you anything extra.

566
40:31.147 --> 40:32.848
Keeping my mouth shut

567
40:33.131 --> 40:34.971
about your content featuring men you've slept with is payment enough.

568
40:35.990 --> 40:36.991
Am I right?

569
40:40.256 --> 40:41.257
Yes.

570
40:41.739 --> 40:43.300
500 is fine, then.

571
40:54.045 --> 40:55.920
- Come here. I'll help push. - Leave me alone.

572
40:55.952 --> 40:57.440
- I'm just trying to help. - Don't!

573
41:00.000 --> 41:02.440
- Hello, Toey! - Hello, Toey!

574
41:03.220 --> 41:05.880
I brought you some fermented chicken tendons today.

575
41:05.990 --> 41:07.900
A little extra calcium

576
41:07.963 --> 41:10.560
to help strengthen your bones!

577
41:10.622 --> 41:15.080
And I brought you Thai apples, imitated the ones from China.

578
41:15.224 --> 41:19.080
Five for 100 baht at Khlong Toei Market.

579
41:20.296 --> 41:22.160
I think you two should take that stuff back.

580
41:22.300 --> 41:23.520
Toey can't eat any of it.

581
41:24.500 --> 41:25.601
How would you know, old lady?

582
41:25.840 --> 41:28.960
Oh, come on! I'm just trying to please my boss!

583
41:29.059 --> 41:31.320
Stop butting in! Are you his wife or something?

584
41:32.627 --> 41:35.120
Toey, would you like some? I'll fry them for you.

585
41:35.140 --> 41:36.400
I bought them raw.

586
41:36.800 --> 41:39.640
Toey, why aren't you saying anything?

587
41:40.011 --> 41:41.600
Why are you just sitting there with your mouth shut?

588
41:42.715 --> 41:44.960
You two really have no idea, do you?

589
41:45.344 --> 41:46.720
Then open your eyes and look!

590
41:50.862 --> 41:53.640
Whoa! He's toothless!

591
41:55.064 --> 41:56.720
Sorry, Toey!

592
41:56.910 --> 41:59.360
How about I chew the food for you

593
41:59.443 --> 42:01.960
and feed it to you one bite at a time?

594
42:02.584 --> 42:04.120
Toey!

595
42:04.221 --> 42:08.800
I brought you sun-dried beef and sticky rice, Toey.

596
42:08.827 --> 42:10.720
And I brought you two things.

597
42:10.828 --> 42:13.248
Sweet rice brittle and crispy noodles.

598
42:13.307 --> 42:15.808
Something to snack on when you're free.

599
42:16.308 --> 42:17.489
Hey, listen!

600
42:18.067 --> 42:21.120
Stop fussing over me and get back to work!

601
42:21.624 --> 42:23.520
If you all worked as hard

602
42:23.710 --> 42:26.100
as you do sucking up to me,

603
42:26.158 --> 42:30.760
Thailand would've become a developed country long ago.

604
42:31.000 --> 42:32.001
Go!

605
42:33.400 --> 42:34.401
Wait!

606
42:35.201 --> 42:37.160
And about what I said earlier,

607
42:38.096 --> 42:39.400
that I'd resign and let you all keep your jobs...

608
42:40.000 --> 42:41.520
I take it back!

609
42:42.700 --> 42:43.701
I'm gonna faint.

610
42:44.192 --> 42:45.193
Go!

611
42:46.656 --> 42:48.257
- Then who's getting fired? - Exactly!

612
42:48.403 --> 42:51.360
- Come on, Sak. I'll wheel Toey back to his office. - Stop!

613
42:51.419 --> 42:53.320
Leave me alone! Get back to work! Go away!

614
42:53.330 --> 42:54.201
Huh?

615
42:54.264 --> 42:56.480
Come on, Toey. I will wheel you back.

616
42:56.600 --> 42:58.395
Easy, Sak! Don't go so fast!

617
42:58.410 --> 42:59.542
- Slowly! - Okay!

618
43:03.500 --> 43:05.201
Wait a second!

619
43:05.520 --> 43:06.521
Hey, Auntie!

620
43:07.000 --> 43:11.640
Don't you think Uncle Sak is trying to outshine you?

621
43:12.174 --> 43:15.520
He doesn't respect his elders at all.

622
43:17.646 --> 43:20.600
I don't mean to stir up trouble,

623
43:20.979 --> 43:22.080
but I think

624
43:22.300 --> 43:25.680
he's definitely after your position as department head.

625
43:26.771 --> 43:28.440
And if he gets it,

626
43:28.998 --> 43:30.680
you'll be cast aside

627
43:30.918 --> 43:33.760
like a stray dog on the street.

628
43:34.758 --> 43:39.182
Then you'll be a gray-haired old hag

629
43:39.220 --> 43:42.960
and an unwanted stray dog.

630
43:46.936 --> 43:49.937
Auntie, you never know.

631
43:50.080 --> 43:54.440
You might even be the one who gets fired

632
43:54.584 --> 43:56.800
along with that Mutta.

633
43:56.843 --> 44:00.000
Ew! What's that smell, Cha-am?

634
44:00.022 --> 44:01.045
What?

635
44:01.152 --> 44:02.600
Something really stinks.

636
44:03.680 --> 44:06.081
Smells like an unwanted stray dog!

637
44:13.681 --> 44:15.700
- You and I are staying. - Why'd you hit me so hard?

638
44:23.560 --> 44:24.561
Veekit.

639
44:32.350 --> 44:34.680
Didn't you say you'd call to remind me to take my antivirals?

640
44:34.750 --> 44:35.880
You never called.

641
44:36.851 --> 44:38.000
Well, you don't need to take them anymore.

642
44:40.622 --> 44:42.720
Aunt Napha just drew your blood for a pregnancy test.

643
44:43.635 --> 44:45.250
She didn't inject you with any germs.

644
44:46.760 --> 44:47.880
So you know everything already?

645
44:50.000 --> 44:52.100
Tetris and Titus overheard their parents fighting.

646
44:52.558 --> 44:53.640
So they told me about it.

647
44:59.123 --> 45:00.280
How are the kids doing?

648
45:01.480 --> 45:02.520
Do they seem stressed?

649
45:02.659 --> 45:03.660
Why do you ask?

650
45:05.992 --> 45:08.904
Wasn't it your plan to tear their family apart?

651
45:12.344 --> 45:13.345
Ta.

652
45:17.200 --> 45:18.501
Come talk to me in my office.

653
45:38.680 --> 45:40.381
Why did you lie to me about being pregnant?

654
45:43.627 --> 45:45.467
I just wanted to test you, Director.

655
45:46.000 --> 45:47.001
Test me?

656
45:47.801 --> 45:49.400
By lying about being pregnant?

657
45:50.112 --> 45:51.520
Why would you need to test me?

658
45:53.900 --> 45:57.301
I just wanted to know if I really got pregnant with your child,

659
45:57.800 --> 45:59.920
would you be ready to start a family with me?

660
46:01.024 --> 46:03.960
Being a mistress is never a secure position.

661
46:04.307 --> 46:05.760
A man can leave you whenever he wants.

662
46:11.774 --> 46:13.175
But now I know

663
46:14.280 --> 46:17.600
that you're truly serious about me and your feelings are genuine.

664
46:18.585 --> 46:19.586
Oh,

665
46:25.971 --> 46:26.972
you silly girl.

666
46:37.838 --> 46:38.839
Ta.

667
46:41.054 --> 46:43.040
Let me assure you

668
46:44.206 --> 46:45.480
that one day,

669
46:46.515 --> 46:50.416
I'll divorce Napha and come live with you. I promise.

670
46:54.963 --> 46:57.250
You don't need to test me

671
46:58.664 --> 47:01.000
or make me prove myself to you ever again, Ta.

672
47:02.190 --> 47:03.191
Understand?

673
47:05.483 --> 47:07.640
Yes, Director.

674
47:08.246 --> 47:09.447
Now I know

675
47:10.300 --> 47:12.601
that you're a man of your word.

676
47:14.100 --> 47:15.200
I'll wait for you.

677
47:16.520 --> 47:19.440
I'll wait for the day we can finally be a real family.

678
47:21.971 --> 47:22.972
Okay.

679
47:24.611 --> 47:26.412
I'll be waiting for that day, too.

680
47:29.464 --> 47:30.465
Ta.

681
47:31.357 --> 47:33.400
Then let's have a little drink to celebrate.

682
47:52.416 --> 47:54.560
I had the pills Jenphop gave you checked.

683
47:54.896 --> 47:57.520
One was a painkiller, and the other was a sleeping pill.

684
47:58.320 --> 47:59.321
As for the suppository,

685
48:00.357 --> 48:01.458
it was an abortion drug.

686
48:07.014 --> 48:08.415
Ta?

687
48:13.760 --> 48:16.450
Why are you looking at me like that? Is something wrong?

688
48:36.731 --> 48:37.960
Whose house have you brought me to?

689
48:38.211 --> 48:39.212
It's a surprise.

690
48:40.883 --> 48:43.080
That dining table looks a little odd to me.

691
48:44.200 --> 48:45.680
When did you two build a house together?

692
48:45.741 --> 48:47.520
- You're going to live with her, aren't you? - Yes, I am!

693
48:51.247 --> 48:54.048
After pulling everything off so successfully,

694
48:54.166 --> 48:56.040
don't I deserve a little reward?

695
49:00.939 --> 49:02.360
Jicama.

696
49:07.590 --> 49:08.880
You're not Mutta, are you?

697
49:10.454 --> 49:13.240
Do you know how many steps there are here?

698
49:14.520 --> 49:15.660
306 steps.

699
49:15.700 --> 49:18.520
Now pick which step you want to die on.
